      <activity id="0127b09a-dd45-5ff1-b71b-546963d8a3a7" activityNameId="0f374a43-cb61-5c3e-8c3d-6fe289137b40" activityNameContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83" type="1" specialActivityType="0" energyValues="0">
        <activityName xml:lang="en">Lean concrete, unspecific, at plant</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Lean concrete, unspecific, at plant
based on ecoinvent 3.2 dataset including data on the composition of the unspecific concrete from Philipp Hubler, Amt für Hochbauten Stadt Zürich\nTechnology: Data from the Amt für Hochbauten, Stadt Zürich. Data approximates average swiss production\nTime period: Time of publications.\nVersion: 1\nEnergy values: Undefined\nLocal category: Mineralische Baustoffe\nLocal subcategory: Beton und Betonwaren\nUVEK 2022 source file:551-Zement-Klinker_v0.9._4 unspez..xml\n\n
UUID: 3d3c71bd-bf3b-3e44-813f-0fc5cedf4370
The activity starts with the ingredients for the concrete at the factory gate. Includes the whole manufacturing processes to produce ready-mixed concrete, internal processes (transport, etc.) and infrastructure. No administration is included.
Location: undefined
Technology: Data from the Amt für Hochbauten, Stadt Zürich. Data approximates average swiss production
Time period: Time of publications.
Production volume: na
Sampling: Measured data of several Swiss plants, intended to be representative for the Swiss production volume 
Extrapolations: &lt;null&gt;
Uncertainty adjustments: &lt;null&gt;
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_3d3c71bd-bf3b-3e44-813f-0fc5cedf4370.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
